<p>Hello <%= @resource.email %>,</p>
<p>Someone has requested to change your password.</p>
<p>If you did not make this request, please ignore this email.  To proceed to change your password, please click the link below:</p>
<p><%= link_to 'Change my password', edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token) %></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Thank you,</p>
<p>MorphoSource Team</p>